# More game files. The disc layout brings kinds the PSN package did not, and
# extensions are listed in both cases because git matches case exactly on
# Linux and macOS. scripts/check_no_game_files.py enforces the same list, and
# more, on content -- an ignore rule alone does not stop `git add -f`.
